{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 04 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">视觉 Transformer：全局交互、层级窗口与高分辨率代价</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision Transformers</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_090_pvt-title\">PVT</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以逐级降低 token 分辨率的 Transformer pyramid 和 spatial-reduction attention 提供多尺度 dense-prediction backbone。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Constructs a progressive four-stage token pyramid using Spatial-Reduction Attention (SRA) to compress K/V resolution before attention.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">高分辨率 2D 图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">High-resolution 2D image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">四级多尺度 Transformer 特征或分类/密集预测输出</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Four-stage multi-scale feature pyramid (1/4 to 1/32 stride) for detection and segmentation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2021/html/Wang_Pyramid_Vision_Transformer_A_Versatile_Backbone_for_Dense_Prediction_Without_ICCV_2021_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_090_pvt')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_090_pvt')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"PVT original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/a52788591965925ce087.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_090_pvt', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_090_pvt\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_090_pvt')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_090_pvt', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_090_pvt\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">高分辨率输入，目标是替代 CNN feature pyramid</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests high-resolution 2d image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"高分辨率输入，目标是替代 CNN feature pyramid\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests high-resolution 2d image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_090_pvt', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">高分辨率输入，目标是替代 CNN feature pyramid</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests high-resolution 2d image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"非重叠 patch embedding 生成最高分辨率 token map\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage-1 patches to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Stage-1 patches\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage-1 patches\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_090_pvt', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Stage-1 patches</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">非重叠 patch embedding 生成最高分辨率 token map</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage-1 patches to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"Spatial-Reduction Attention 在计算 K/V 前按比例下采样 token，Q 保持原分辨率\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SRA within the core pyramidal spatial reduction transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"SRA\" data-node-name-en=\"SRA\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_090_pvt', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>SRA</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">Spatial-Reduction Attention 在计算 K/V 前按比例下采样 token，Q 保持原分辨率</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SRA within the core pyramidal spatial reduction transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"SRA、MLP、LayerNorm 与 residual 组成各 stage 编码块\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Transformer block within the core pyramidal spatial reduction transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Transformer block\" data-node-name-en=\"Transformer block\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_090_pvt', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Transformer block</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">SRA、MLP、LayerNorm 与 residual 组成各 stage 编码块</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Transformer block within the core pyramidal spatial reduction transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"阶段间重排/嵌入降低 H×W、增加 channel，形成金字塔\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Patch downsampling within the core pyramidal spatial reduction transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Patch 下采样\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch downsampling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_090_pvt', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Patch 下采样</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Patch downsampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">阶段间重排/嵌入降低 H×W、增加 channel，形成金字塔</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Patch downsampling within the core pyramidal spatial reduction transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出 {F1,F2,F3,F4}，空间分辨率逐级降低\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs feature within the core pyramidal spatial reduction transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"四级特征\" data-node-name-en=\"feature\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_090_pvt', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">四级特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出 {F1,F2,F3,F4}，空间分辨率逐级降低</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs feature within the core pyramidal spatial reduction transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"分类 head 或 FPN/检测/分割 decoder 消费多尺度特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Task Head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"任务头\" data-node-name-en=\"Task Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_090_pvt', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Task Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">分类 head 或 FPN/检测/分割 decoder 消费多尺度特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Task Head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"分类或密集输出\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces four-stage multi-scale feature pyramid (1/4 to 1/32 stride) for detection and segmentation via prediction.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"预测\" data-node-name-en=\"prediction\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_090_pvt', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预测</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prediction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">分类或密集输出</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces four-stage multi-scale feature pyramid (1/4 to 1/32 stride) for detection and segmentation via prediction.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"PVT Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 压缩 K/V 的空间降采样注意力</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Spatial-Reduction Attention (SRA) for Multi-Scale Pyramid Tokens</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"PVT：核心公式 · 压缩 K/V 的空间降采样注意力\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"90\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"24.4833pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.594345 -69.00913 198.515725 24.4833\" width=\"198.515725pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.364717 23.265184C1.865979 21.002188 1.459037 15.01716 1.459037 11.35468C1.459037 7.682275 1.865979 2.114114 3.364717-.148881L3.235687-.555824C1.786576 1.607918 .496271 4.774127 .496271 11.35468C.496271 17.925308 1.846128 21.885551 3.235687 23.672126L3.364717 23.265184Z\" id=\"m090_g4-18\"></path><path d=\"M.297763 23.265184L.426793 23.672126C1.816352 21.885551 3.166209 17.925308 3.166209 11.35468C3.166209 4.774127 1.875904 1.607918 .426793-.555824L.297763-.148881C1.796501 2.1